WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.400
Crouching heavy punch starts the combo.

2
00:00:01.400 --> 00:00:02.600
Perfect medium Flash Knuckle launches Ryu.

3
00:00:02.600 --> 00:00:03.550
Perfect light Flash Knuckle continues the route.

4
00:00:03.550 --> 00:00:04.250
Heavy Flash Knuckle connects before the Super cancel.

5
00:00:04.250 --> 00:00:06.900
Luke activates Pale Rider from heavy Knuckle.

6
00:00:06.900 --> 00:00:09.900
Pale Rider completes and leaves Ryu hard-knocked down.
